messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2176
Function: libxml_xmlRegisterXPathFunction
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The result of xmlRealloc is assigned directly to libxml_xpathCallbacks without a NULL check. On realloc failure, libxml_xpathCallbacks becomes NULL and the code then writes to (*libxml_xpathCallbacks)[i], leading to a NULL pointer dereference.

